<title>HUNGARY: BSE TO LIST 90,000 HUMAN SHARES ON DEC 2.</title>
<headline>BSE TO LIST 90,000 HUMAN SHARES ON DEC 2.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) decided to list the drug maker Human Rt's 90,000 ordinary shares, with an effect of December 2, the BSE said in its official gazette on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares, which had been converted from employee shares, each have a face value of 1,000 forints, the BSE said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
